openelis | /session | login-page | session probe used by the login page
openelis | /ChangePasswordLogin | login-page | password change before login
openelis | /UpdateLoginChangePassword | login-page | password change before login
openelis | /fontawesome-free-5.13.1-web/** | static-asset | static
openelis | /select2/** | static-asset | static
openelis | /css/** | static-asset | static
openelis | /favicon/** | static-asset | static
openelis | /images/** | static-asset | static
openelis | /documentation/** | static-asset | static
openelis | /scripts/** | static-asset | static
openelis | /jsp/** | static-asset | static JSP fragments
openelis | /docs/UserManual | static-asset | user manual
openelis | /health/** | health | health probe
openelis | /rest/open-configuration-properties | login-page | config the login page needs before auth
openelis | /rest/site-branding/** | login-page | logo/branding for the login page
openelis | /rest/supportedlocales/active | login-page | locale list for the login page
